	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et vitae innocentiam a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p8055">Blaurero</persName> non <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>possum non bene sentire, vir in domino mihi plurimum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>observande, utpote homine et pio et docto, et qui lu<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>culentissimis ad nos epistolis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8055">Blarers</persName> Erklärung ist nicht erhalten.</note> scriptis sancte testatus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>est se de pristina sua sententia nihil mutasse.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Non ipse <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>primus huius confessionis<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l572">Württemberger</placeName> Abendmahlskonkordie (s. oben <ref target="file10459">[Nr. 424]</ref> S. 279, Anm. 47; vgl. <hi>Köhler,</hi> ZL II 320-358). Zu <persName ref="p4349">Karlstadts</persName> Verdacht, <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName> mache darin den Schwachen im Glauben zu große Konzessionen, s. seinen vorausgegangenen Brief an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vom 27. September 1534, oben <ref target="file10479">Nr. 444</ref>; vgl. <bibl source="b89">Barge</bibl> II 463.</note> author est, sed certo consilio <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>iam olim ab aliis concompositam protraxit atque tur<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>bulentum <persName ref="p6469">Schneppffii</persName> ingenium hac arte sancta sedavit<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zum Entstehen der Konkordie zwischen <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> und <persName ref="p6469">Erhard Schnepf</persName> s. <hi>Köhler,</hi> ZL II 335-337.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Iam vero quantumvis sim stupidus, attamen <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>adeo vaesanus non sum, ut istum syncretismum, cuius <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>occasionem et consilium non nescio, pro contione publica <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>eveham ipsumque ecclesiae nostrae commendem<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Diesbezügliche Befürchtungen äußerte <persName ref="p4349">Karlstadt</persName> am 27. September 1534, s. oben <ref target="file10479">Nr. 444</ref>; vgl. <bibl source="b89">Barge</bibl> II 463.</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Mihi crede, frater <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>charissime, huius ne verbo quidem a quoquam nostrum mentionem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>esse factam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Alia sunt, quae nobis inculcanda sunt <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nostris quam substantialitates et quantitates imaginariae.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Ubi vero occasio iusserit de eucharistiae sacro disserere, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nos id ecclesiae nostrae tradimus, quod ei traditum est ab <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>initio a sanctae memoriae viro <persName ref="p4091">H[uldrycho] Zvinglio</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Zur Abendmahlslehre Zwinglis s. Ulrich <hi>Gäbler,</hi> <persName ref="p4091">Huldrych Zwingli</persName> im 20. Jahrhundert. Forschungsbericht und annotierte Bibliographie 1897-1972, Zürich 1975, S. 81-90 (mit Lit.).</note> et quod <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ipse iam ferme decimum in annum credidi et docui<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Zur Abendmahlslehre des jungen <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> s. <bibl source="b605">Staedtke</bibl> 234-254.</note>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Non <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ergo est, quod tu vel alii vereantur nos recantare, quod <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>hactenus bene docuimus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Neque <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName>, nisi prorsus fallat <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et propriis in epistolis mentiatur, quicquam revocavit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quin <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nuper commentarios nostros in Paulum ad Corinthios<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, «Commentarius in priorem Pauli ad Corinthios epistolam», <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, Juni 1534 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 53).</note> tantum non <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>approbavit<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Siehe <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, 8. Juli 1534, oben S. 246, 2-6 und <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName>, 3. Oktober 1534, <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW I 559f; <hi>Köhler,</hi> ZL II 349.</note>, maxime id quod de eucharistia tradidimus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>in cap. II<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Siehe <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, «Commentarius in priorem...», aaO, f. 132r.-152r. (De eucharistia).</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Est nescio quis apud vos spiritus turbulentus, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>qui subinde infausta quaedam de <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> fratribus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> spargit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Oro, ne quid temere de nobis credatis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Interim gratias tibi ingentes habeo, quod amice nos mo<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nueris.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Obtestor te per communem fidem, ut tali in nos animo <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>semper esse pergas.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nam nos tui sumus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">In monimentum <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>amicitiae nunquam intermoriturae mitto tibi ea, quae de <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>vera Christi divinitate et humanitate 1. octobris aedidimus<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, «Assertio utriusque in Christo naturae», <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> 1534 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 62).</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">[In]<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Von</hi> [In] <hi>bis</hi> com[pe]ries <hi>am Rande nachgetragen; infolge zu straffen Einbandes an vier Stellen unlesbar.</hi></note> calce non[nu]lla de [eu]charistia com[pe]<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ries<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Von</hi> [In] <hi>bis</hi> com[pe]ries <hi>am Rande nachgetragen; infolge zu straffen Einbandes an vier Stellen unlesbar.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Siehe <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>, «Assertio ...», aaO, f. 64r.-67v.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vive, vale, frater amantissime et in Christo nobis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>plurimum observande.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><pb type="edition" next="339"/>Vale cum <persName ref="p1365">Gryneo</persName>, <persName ref="p8054">Marco</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8054">Markus Bertschi</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>nostro tuaque familia.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Salvum te volunt <persName ref="p8051">uxor</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="13"><persName ref="p8051">Anna Bullinger, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p7042">mater</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="14"><persName ref="p7042">Anna Bullinger, geb. Wiederkehr</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>vicini.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">4. octobris 1534.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><persName ref="p495">H. Bullingerus</persName> tuus</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctori <persName ref="p4349">Andreae Carolostadio</persName>, verbi <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>apud <placeName ref="l28">Basileienses</placeName> ministro, fratri in <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino et venerando plurimum et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>longe charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
